VEJmVnYwbldoalRxbFRDcGlIekJ5elVKSmctbkdETHh6WDI1VkQzeG8xVTlJYmlyaUFTYTNrWE5BZXFsVkp4TU41M21LLUs1Znc?oc=5","date":"2026-10-09","zh":"SpaceX Spectrum 交易激發塔產業樂觀情緒，Crown Castle 躍升"},{"title":"SpaceX's $8 Billion Spectrum Purchase Sends Telecom Stocks Tumbling","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTFAxcy1ZT1BPVzl1REYtZUxtWHJUZUpUcjJ3TkZYN0xnQUwtZnlQXzJDMGxXcmY2bERCSmpxUllXajNBbFlRYjYxN2JuUnhFalhxZmRuZjVqN0JjZ1hHNlJKaDN4ODZSOVpxWl9Od1Jzb19Kd3lLbHc?oc=5","date":"2026-10-09","zh":"SpaceX 斥資 80 億美元購買頻譜導致電信股暴跌"}],"themes":[{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"減重藥/生技","count":1},{"name":"財報","count":1},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1},{"name":"併購","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-24","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1053507/000105350726000035/amt-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We are one of the largest global real estate investment trusts and a leading independent owner, operator and developer of multitenant communications real estate. Our primary business is the leasing of space on communications sites to wireless service providers, radio and television broadcast companies, wireless data providers, government agencies and municipalities and tenants in a number of other industries. We refer to this business, inclusive of our data center business discussed below, as our property operations, which accounted for 97% of our total revenues for the year ended December 31, 2025. We also offer tower-related services in the United States, which we refer to as our services operations. These services include site application, zoning and permitting, structural and mount analyses, and construction management services, together with program management offerings that support","zh":"我們是全球最大的房地產投資信託公司之一，也是領先的多租戶通訊房地產獨立所有者、營運商和開發商。我們的主要業務是將通訊站點空間租賃給無線服務提供者、廣播電視廣播公司、無線資料提供者、政府機構和市政當局以及許多其他行業的租戶。我們將這項業務（包括下文討論的資料中心業務）稱為我們的財產業務，占我們截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日止年度總收入的 97%。我們也在美國提供與鐵塔相關的服務，我們稱之為我們的服務業務。這些服務包括場地申請、分區和許可、結構和安裝分析以及施工管理服務，以及支援專案管理服務"},{"en":"Since inception, we have grown our communications real estate portfolio through acquisitions, long-term lease arrangements and site development. Our portfolio primarily consists of towers that we own and towers that we operate pursuant to long-term lease arrangements, as well as distributed antenna system (\"DAS\") networks, which provide seamless coverage solutions in certain in-building and outdoor wireless environments. In addition to the communications sites in our portfolio, we manage rooftop and tower sites for property owners under various contractual arrangements. We also hold other telecommunications infrastructure, fiber and property interests that we lease primarily to communications service providers and third-party tower operators, and, as discussed further below, we hold a portfolio of highly interconnected data center facilities and related assets in the United States that w","zh":"自成立以來，我們透過收購、長期租賃安排和場地開發擴大了我們的通訊房地產投資組合。我們的產品組合主要包括我們擁有的塔樓和我們根據長期租賃安排運營的塔樓，以及分佈式天線系統（“DAS”）網路，該網路在某些室內和室外無線環境中提供無縫覆蓋解決方案。除了我們投資組合中的通訊站點外，我們還根據各種合約安排為業主管理屋頂和塔樓站點。我們也持有其他電信基礎設施、光纖和財產權益，主要出租給通訊服務供應商和第三方塔運營商，並且如下文進一步討論的，我們在美國持有高度互聯的資料中心設施和相關資產組合，這些資產包括："},{"en":"As of December 31, 2025, our communications real estate portfolio of 149,686 communications sites included 42,224 communications sites in the U.S. & Canada, 27,857 communications sites in Africa & APAC (as defined below), 32,524 communications sites in Europe and 47,081 communications sites in Latin America, as well as (i) urban telecommunications assets in Argentina, Brazil, Colombia and Spain, (ii) other property interests in Canada and the United States and (iii) 30 operating data center facilities across eleven markets in the United States.","zh":"截至2025年12月31日，我們的通訊房地產投資組合由149,686個通訊站點組成，其中包括美國和加拿大的42,224個通信站點、非洲和亞太地區（定義見下文）的27,857個通信站點、歐洲的32,524個通信站點和拉丁美洲的47,081個通信站點(Mi) interests in Canada and the United States and (iii) 30 operating data center facilities across eleven markets in the United States."}],"markets":[{"en":"Our property operations accounted for 97%, 98% and 99% of our total revenues for the years ended December 31, 2025, 2024 and 2023, respectively. Our revenue is primarily generated from tenant leases. Within our tower leasing operations, our tenants lease space on our communications real estate, where they install and maintain their equipment. Rental payments vary considerably depending upon numerous factors, including, but not limited to, amount, type and position of tenant equipment on the tower, remaining tower capacity and tower location. Our costs typically include ground rent (which is primarily fixed under long-term lease agreements with annual cost escalations) and power and fuel costs, some or all of which may be passed through to our tenants, as well as property taxes and repair and maintenance expenses. Our property operations have generated consistent growth in revenue and typ","zh":"截至2025年12月31日、2024年及2023年12月31日止年度，我們的房地產業務分別占我們總收入的97%、98%及99%。我们的收入主要来自租户租赁。在我們的塔樓租賃業務中，我們的租戶在我們的通訊地產上租賃空間，在那裡安裝和維護設備。租金費用根據多種因素而有很大差異，包括但不限於塔上租戶設備的數量、類型和位置、剩餘塔容量和塔位置。我們的成本通常包括地租（主要根據長期租賃協議確定，且每年成本都會上漲）、電力和燃料成本（其中部分或全部可能轉嫁給我們的租戶），以及財產稅以及維修和保養費用。我們的房地產業務實現了收入和類型的持續成長"},{"en":"Long-term tenant leases with contractual rent escalations. In general, our tenant leases for our communications sites with wireless carriers have initial non-cancellable terms of five to ten years with multiple renewal terms, with provisions that periodically increase the rent due under the lease, typically annually, based on a fixed escalation percentage (averaging approximately 3% in the United States) or an inflationary index in most of our international markets, or a combination of both. Based upon foreign currency exchange rates and the tenant leases in place as of December 31, 2025, we expect to generate over $54 billion of non-cancellable tenant lease revenue over future periods, before the impact of straight-line lease accounting.","zh":"长期租户租赁合同租金上涨。一般而言，我們與無線營運商的通訊站點的租戶租約具有五到十年的初始不可取消期限，並具有多個續約期限，並根據固定的上漲百分比（美國平均約為 3%）或大多數國際市場的通貨膨脹指數，或兩者的組合，定期（通常每年）增加租約下的應付租金。根據外幣匯率和截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日的租戶租賃，在直線租賃會計影響之前，我們預計未來期間將產生超過 540 億美元的不可撤銷租戶租賃收入。"}],"customers":[{"en":"We are one of the largest global real estate investment trusts and a leading independent owner, operator and developer of multitenant communications real estate. Our primary business is the leasing of space on communications sites to wireless service providers, radio and television broadcast companies, wireless data providers, government agencies and municipalities and tenants in a number of other industries. We refer to this business, inclusive of our data center business discussed below, as our property operations, which accounted for 97% of our total revenues for the year ended December 31, 2025. We also offer tower-related services in the United States, which we refer to as our services operations. These services include site application, zoning and permitting, structural and mount analyses, and construction management services, together with program management offerings that support","zh":"我們是全球最大的房地產投資信託公司之一，也是領先的多租戶通訊房地產獨立所有者、營運商和開發商。我們的主要業務是將通訊站點空間租賃給無線服務提供者、廣播電視廣播公司、無線資料提供者、政府機構和市政當局以及許多其他行業的租戶。我們將這項業務（包括下文討論的資料中心業務）稱為我們的財產業務，占我們截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日止年度總收入的 97%。我們也在美國提供與鐵塔相關的服務，我們稱之為我們的服務業務。這些服務包括場地申請、分區和許可、結構和安裝分析以及施工管理服務，以及支援專案管理服務"}],"competition":[{"en":"Our industry is highly competitive. There are frequently new market participants that create additional competition. We compete, both for new business and for the acquisition of assets, with other public tower companies, such as Crown Castle International Corp., SBA Communications Corporation, Vertical Bridge, Telesites S.A.B. de C.V. and Cellnex Telecom, S.A., wireless carrier tower consortia and private tower companies, private equity sponsored firms, carrier-affiliated tower companies, independent wireless carriers, tower owners, broadcasters and owners of non-communications sites, including rooftops, utility towers, water towers and other alternative structures. Our data center business also competes with a variety of companies offering similar data center solutions and services, including space, power, interconnection and development services. We believe that location and capacity, ","zh":"我們的行業競爭非常激烈。經常有新的市場參與者產生額外的競爭。我們在新業務和資產收購方面與其他上市塔公司競爭，例如 Crown Castle International Corp.、SBA Communications Corporation、Vertical Bridge、Telesites S.A.B. de C.V.和 Cellnex Telecom, S.A.、無線運營商鐵塔聯盟和私人鐵塔公司、私募股權贊助公司、運營商附屬鐵塔公司、獨立運營商鐵塔聯盟和私人鐵塔公司、私塔贊助公司、運營商附屬設施公司、獨立運營商、非無線運營商、非服務公司、無線運營商和其他結構公司的建築公司、獨立運營商。我們的資料中心業務也與提供類似資料中心解決方案和服務的各種公司競爭，包括空間、電力、互連和開發服務。我們相信，位置和容量，"},{"en":"Our services business competes with a variety of companies offering individual, or combinations of, competing services. The field of competitors includes site application consultants, zoning consultants, real estate firms, right-of-way consultants, structural engineering firms, construction management firms, tower owners/managers, telecommunications equipment vendors who can provide turnkey site development services through multiple subcontractors and our tenants' personnel. We believe that our tenants base their decisions for services on various criteria, including a company's experience, local reputation, price and time for completion of a project.","zh":"我們的服務業務與提供單獨或組合競爭服務的各種公司競爭。競爭對手領域包括場地申請顧問、分區顧問、房地產公司、路權顧問、結構工程公司、施工管理公司、塔樓業主/經理、電信設備供應商，他們可以透過多個分包商和我們的租戶人員提供交鑰匙場地開發服務。我們相信，我們的租戶會根據各種標準做出服務決定，包括公司的經驗、當地聲譽、價格和專案完成時間。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Property","val":10305000000,"zh":"財產"},{"name":"Property US & Canada","val":5588300000,"zh":"美國和加拿大房產"},{"name":"Property Latin America","val":1642600000,"zh":"拉丁美洲房地產"},{"name":"Property Africa APAC","val":1422900000,"zh":"非洲地產亞太區"},{"name":"Property Data Centers","val":1053099999.9999999,"zh":"物業資料中心"},{"name":"Property Europe","val":937700000,"zh":"歐洲地產"},{"name":"Services","val":339600000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":10644600000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Property Revenue","val":10305000000,"zh":"物業收入"},{"name":"Non Lease Property Revenue","val":596300000,"zh":"非租賃財產收入"},{"name":"Service","val":339600000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Services Revenue","val":339600000,"zh":"服務收入"}],"total":10644600000}},"peers":["CCI","DLR","PLD","EQIX","SBAC"]}}